          <a href="#warranty" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. What the Warranty Does and Does Not Cover</a>
          <a href="#extended-warranties" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. Are Extended Warranties Worth It?</a>
